# 1. Brainstorming & Ideation Phase

**Project Name:** FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

## Problem
People often find it difficult to create a workout plan suitable for their fitness goals.

## Idea
FitBuddy uses Gemini AI to generate personalized 7-day fitness plans based on user details.

## Key Features
* Personalized workout plans
* Nutrition and recovery tips
* Feedback-based plan updates
* User and plan storage

## Target Users
* Students
* Beginners
* Fitness enthusiasts

## Expected Outcome
To develop a simple AI-powered application that provides personalized fitness plans.
